19
00:02:00.356 --> 00:02:06.024
I have two eyes, two ears and one mouth. I use my hands and my feet every day.

20
00:02:06.074 --> 00:02:07.483
I like this story!

21
00:02:08.183 --> 00:02:13.296
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:13.346 --> 00:02:14.483
Foot!

23
00:02:15.187 --> 00:02:20.674
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:20.724 --> 00:02:21.874
Nose!

25
00:02:22.762 --> 00:02:30.445
Think and answer. How many eyes do you have?

26
